# Two failing tests added ahead of the impl (red-first):
#   1. crates/dispatch/tests/route_ctx_tdd.rs::matched_label_borrows_precomputed_pattern_arc
#      — pins spec item 2's zero-alloc label: the matched-with-context label
#      must SHARE the precomputed `RouteContext.pattern` Arc (pointer identity),
#      not clone it into a fresh `String`. Today `MatchDecision.label: String`
#      so `Arc::as_ptr(&m.label)` does not typecheck → compile failure (red).
#   2. crates/server/src/metrics.rs::register_routes_freezes_dynamic_labels
#      — pins spec item 4's lock-free pattern beyond the registered-route case:
#      the dynamic labels `_unmatched` / `_proxy` / `_data` (fired on every 404,
#      proxy pass and data request) must be in the frozen map so their observe
#      takes no write lock. Today `register_routes` freezes only the route
#      patterns the boot hands in → `is_frozen_label("_unmatched")` is false →
#      assertion failure (red).

